WEBVTT

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.120
I can take you into the mine as agreed.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.580
But you'll be on your own once you're inside.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.920
Don't worry about what happens inside.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.720
What about what you promised me?

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.560
What I promised won't change.

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:53.160
But you better not play any tricks.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:54.090
I wouldn't dare.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.160
One word from you and my head is gone.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.400
I'll handle them.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.000
Officer.

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:04.760
Halt!

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:05.600
Officer.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.330
Papers. We're on the same side.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:11.490
Officer.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:13.770
We are under Colonel Matsuda's orders

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.200
to bring two translators for him to see.

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:22.610
Thank you, officer.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:26.220
Let's go. Okay.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:40.480
Masao Tahara is here.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:41.800
He has seen me.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.079
Why don't you hide first?

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:50.360
Mr. Meng.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:51.720
Officer.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:52.560
Officer.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:55.400
Mr. Meng.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:57.280
Officer.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.680
These stupid Chinese

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:01.000
have dug the mine to the point of collapse.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:01.680
Yes.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.120
Did you find the translators I asked for?

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:04.720
Yes, I did.

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:06.520
These are the new translators.

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.380
Hello, Officer. My surname is Xu.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.120
Xu. Xu.

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:16.960
Xu.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.040
Hurry up and find him.

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:20.640
Tahara Masao will be back soon.

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.320
Neither of us will be able to leave, I'm telling you.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:23.160
What are you talking about?

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:23.960
I'm telling you,

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:25.640
Tahara Masao is chasing Cui Wenpei now.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:27.560
He won't have time for us for a while.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.480
If we can't find

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.680
the person we're looking for this time,

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:30.540
then next time,

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.040
you'll have to bring us in again.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:32.960
My God!

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:35.079
Do you think this is a restaurant or a tavern?

00:03:35.079 --> 00:03:37.280
You can't just come and go as you please.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.400
You were outside just now

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.560
and almost sold me out.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:42.120
Did you think I didn't notice?

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:42.880
Let me tell you,

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:44.740
if you make a fuss again this time,

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.920
believe it or not, I'll give you a grenade

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.380
and send you to hell early.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.280
Xu, if I wanted to harm you,

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:51.880
would you still be standing here?

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.140
You're the boss, okay?

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:54.280
Hurry up and go.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:56.020
Hurry up, I'll keep watch.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:56.880
Go.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:03:59.160
Go.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:06.560
Ascend to the Heavenly Terrace.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:09.840
Protect my life and body.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.400
Compete on the same stage.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.680
Calm the spirit and mind.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.560
Mysterious realm and underworld.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.200
Who are you?

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:25.880
How do you know

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:28.540
the rallying call of our Eighteen Strongholds?

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.080
Are you Master Six?

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.720
Yes, I am Wu Laoliu.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.810
Which stronghold are you from?

00:04:35.159 --> 00:04:35.880
Come.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:40.860
Yuanshangfei told me.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.300
He asked me to find you.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:43.460
Yuanshangfei?

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:44.040
Yes.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.920
How are the Eldest Miss and the others?

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:46.980
Are they all right?

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.240
They've joined the Eighth Route Army guerrilla forces.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:53.640
And they are both vice-captains now.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.760
They know you were captured and brought to the mine,

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.720
and have been trying to rescue you.

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:02.160
It's rare.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.000
The Eldest Miss and Chief Yuan

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.160
still remember me.

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.800
I, Wu Laoliu, will keep it in my heart.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:10.040
By the way,

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:11.720
do you have any plans?

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.400
I can cooperate with you.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:17.720
They plan to attack the mine in a while.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.680
When the time comes, they hope you can

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:20.740
organize everyone

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.960
so we can evacuate in an orderly manner.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:23.920
No problem.

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:26.840
Half of the people in the cave

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.280
are my brothers.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.240
As soon as I give the order,

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.840
whether it's protecting the civilians

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.640
or helping you fight the Japs,

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:36.159
it won't be a problem.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.000
That's great.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.730
With your cooperation,

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.400
we can attack from inside and outside,

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.000
and catch the Japs off guard.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:43.920
Good.

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:45.880
That's great.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.080
I've been holding in this anger,

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.970
and now I can finally let it out.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:54.850
Although we swordsmen don't have our swords,

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.840
But our unyielding spirit remains.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.760
Even if I die here and can't get out,

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:05.160
I will take a few Japanese devils down with me.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:35.760
Xiaoni.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.480
How did you get like this?

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:53.880
Wenpei.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.000
I... I stole the map,

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.040
and gave it to Tianyuan Zhengxiong.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.800
I wanted to save my dad.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.160
I just wanted to save my dad.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:13.000
Let's go.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:14.560
Go back with me.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.840
To defeat the Japs,

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.400
we must first understand

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.000
their combat techniques.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.720
For example, the Japs excel at bayonet fighting.

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:40.580
That is because

00:08:40.679 --> 00:08:42.880
they practice thousands of times a day.

00:08:42.919 --> 00:08:44.440
Actually, the movements are very simple,

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.160
just three steps.

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:47.120
Lunge, parry, and block.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:50.200
But under long-term rigorous training,

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.920
these skills become natural reflexes.

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.240
A half-second thrust is either fatal or crippling.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.300
Many of my comrades

00:08:57.440 --> 00:08:59.300
suffered a lot from the Japanese.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:01.480
But the broadswords in our hands

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:04.530
can effectively counter their bayonet charges.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.340
Close combat is our broadswords' strong point.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.120
As long as we rush into

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.960
their rifle's blind spot,

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:13.400
we can effectively counter them.

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:15.800
Now we will give you a demonstration.

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:17.000
Watch closely.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.000
Mr. Li.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.580
Everyone, watch closely.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:22.240
Come on.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.400
Block, grab,

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:25.520
and kill.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:26.960
One more time.

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:28.040
Come on.

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:30.280
Block, grab, kill.

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:32.000
Come on.

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:33.360
Pair up freely

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:34.480
and practice.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.440
Ying'er, Baozi.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:40.360
Hurry up.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:42.280
Hurry.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:43.170
Old Li. Here.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:44.520
Lead everyone in training.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:45.360
Hurry, hurry! Okay.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:46.440
The rest of you, come with me.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:47.280
Yes.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:48.360
Careful.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.480
What happened to Xiaoni?

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.320
When I was evading the enemies,

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.080
I found Xiaoni among the corpses.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.340
Quickly see how she is.

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:05.740
I will go find a doctor.

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:08.320
Baozi, get her some water and food.

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:09.280
Okay.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:16.120
Ying,

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:17.940
I'll leave this to you.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:35.040
Ni.

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:38.000
Sister,

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:41.400
is it really you?

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:42.880
Sister.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:45.960
Sister,

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.680
I thought I would never,

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:53.160
never see you again.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.120
I'm sorry.

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:01.680
I shouldn't have listened to the Japanese's nonsense

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:04.960
and stolen your map.

00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:07.280
Sister.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.560
Stop talking. Don't say that.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.650
It's good that you're back.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.040
Nothing is more important than you coming back.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.770
Everything else is in the past.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.560
Sister,

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.720
it hurts so much.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.480
I know it hurts.

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:29.880
Bear with it a little longer.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.840
Wenpei has gone to find a doctor.

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.090
It'll be fine once the doctor arrives.

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:38.240
Sister,

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:41.080
there's something

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:43.960
I want to ask of you.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:46.440
Tell me.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.210
I'll promise you anything.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.880
I want to ask you

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:56.960
not to kill my dad,

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:00.080
okay?

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:01.600
I know

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:04.960
this is too much to ask.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:09.120
But he didn't do it willingly.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.480
He only went down the wrong path

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:14.560
for me and my mom.

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:17.360
Sister.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.580
You're in this condition,

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.130
and you're still pleading for him.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:26.680
No matter what,

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.960
he's still my dad.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:33.720
Sister, I beg you.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:36.400
Please.

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:38.720
Sister.

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:39.800
Sister.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:40.720
Okay.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.280
I promise you.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:46.980
But you have to promise me too.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:49.160
You have to stay alive, okay?

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:05.640
Mi.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:09.760
Give this to my dad.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.880
Tell him to stop doing bad things.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:20.400
Now no one is threatening him.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:27.480
Tell him to take good care of himself from now on.

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:30.400
If he misses me,

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:34.720
he can look at this necklace.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.600
Xiaoni.

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:51.840
I really want to go back to Qinglong Stronghold.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.680
I really want to eat the pears from the back mountain.

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.240
I really want

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:03.200
to go

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:06.480
home.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:23.800
Ni.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:41.880
Ni.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.480
Talk to me again.

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:54.320
Say something to me, Ni.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:56.440
Ni.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:06.040
Ni.

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:29.480
Ni,

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.330
these are all your favorite foods.

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:36.720
This is the closest place to Qinglong Stronghold.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.480
I hope you like it.

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:53.120
The Japanese devils ruined her life.

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:56.400
Tahara Masao killed Aunt Meixiang,

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:59.360
making her lose her most beloved relative.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.240
This blood debt,

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:04.480
we will settle with him sooner or later.

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:06.760
But what we need to do right now

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.600
is to help Xiaoni

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:10.330
fulfill her unfulfilled wish.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:13.320
Qinglong Stronghold has been occupied by the Japanese.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.280
We can't get anywhere near it.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.600
After Uncle Banjin died,

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.640
the secret passage is gone too.

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:22.160
He Xiaobian hides in the stronghold every day,

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.280
like he's dead,

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.010
with no movement at all.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.240
How do we get close?

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.360
I thought of a way.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:34.480
Come up.

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.080
Boss Cai.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:39.400
Miss.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:46.490
What are you doing here?

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:47.240
I...

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:48.280
Ying'er,

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:51.240
The method I mentioned needs his help.

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:53.240
What do you mean?

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.100
Wait, what do you want me to do now?

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.680
I have already risked my life

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.800
to help you once before.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:59.720
Don't make me do anything dangerous again.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.000
I have a family to support now.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.000
If I die,

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:04.740
what will happen to my wife and children?

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:05.680
Don't panic.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.930
It's a very simple favor this time.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.160
Go to Qinglong Stronghold and bring Advisor He down the mountain.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.000
That's it?

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:13.520
I can do that,

00:17:13.839 --> 00:17:14.680
but that old guy,

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:16.540
I don't know if he will believe me.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:19.400
Ying'er.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.920
Give this to Master He.

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:50.290
He will follow your orders.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:52.850
All right, I'll go then.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.040
Master He.

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:22.040
Still in the mood to drink?

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:25.610
What are you doing here?

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:29.000
I don't recall your detective squad

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:32.200
having any official business in Qinglong Stronghold.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:33.480
Drop the act.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:34.840
We are both now

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:36.920
in the exact same situation.

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.860
We both work for Masao Tahara.

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.140
The difference is,

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:42.520
I only betrayed Huo Lang

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:45.440
and now act as an informant for the Japanese.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:48.300
But I don't have the blood of my brothers on my hands.

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:50.000
You are different.

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.720
Every swordsman in Sandaoyuan

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.410
wants you dead the moment they see you.

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:06.320
Did you come to Qinglong Stronghold

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:08.840
just to talk this nonsense to me?

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:10.200
Of course not.

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:12.850
I was entrusted by someone to find you.

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:15.250
Someone told me to give this to you.

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:10.640
Ni'er.

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:16.920
This isn't true.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.360
Tian Yuanzhengxiong promised me

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.020
he wouldn't hurt my daughter.

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.440
I did everything he asked me to do.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:28.130
Why did he hurt my daughter?

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.620
Only you would believe the Japanese.

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.760
Do you know where we found Xiaoni?

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:38.480
Do you know what she went through?

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:40.400
Where?

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:43.880
We carried her out of a pile of dead bodies.

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.800
When we found her,

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.420
she was covered in wounds and on her last breath.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:21:00.240
You caused all of this.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.400
You killed my father,

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:03.960
killed so many brothers,

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:06.920
then my aunt, and now Xiaoni.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:11.380
Even when she died, she was thinking of you, her father.

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:12.480
She said,

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:14.880
only if she dies

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:17.640
can you be free from any restraints.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.880
Only then can you be a good man again.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:22.000
Only then can you live in peace.

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:23.640
Stop talking.

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:26.560
Stop.

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:27.800
Stop it.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:29.900
I just wanted to tell you all this.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:32.500
You're even afraid to listen now.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.840
What about Xiaoni?

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.440
What did she go through?

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:47.240
It's all my sin.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.160
It's all my fault.

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:55.420
I've let every single one of you down.

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:02.160
Ying'er.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.000
Kill me.

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:08.800
I deserve to die.

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:11.080
Kill you?

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:16.640
If you die,

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:19.800
will they come back to life?

00:22:22.680 --> 00:22:24.080
I promised Xiaoni

00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:26.200
I wouldn't kill you.

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:30.480
So I absolutely won't.

00:22:51.600 --> 00:22:52.880
Ni'er.

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:05.000
Go.

00:23:07.720 --> 00:23:08.640
Hurry.

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:18.080
The gold mining has been progressing very fast these past few days.

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:19.520
It looks like we'll finish

00:23:19.520 --> 00:23:21.520
General Kurokawa's task very soon.

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.320
It's all thanks to your full supervision, Colonel,

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:27.120
that these Chinese laborers don't dare slack off.

00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:29.920
However, I think we still need to

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:31.960
speed up our mining.

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:34.760
Why do you say that?

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:36.320
A few days ago,

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.800
I noticed Cui Wenpei around here.

00:23:38.920 --> 00:23:42.160
Plus, Cui Wenkui of the Independent Brigade has been redeploying his troops frequently,

00:23:42.160 --> 00:23:45.220
seemingly intending to advance towards the gold mine.

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:47.960
I don't think their actions are a coincidence.

00:23:48.200 --> 00:23:50.160
They must have reached an agreement

00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:52.000
to attack our gold mine.

00:23:53.720 --> 00:23:56.320
With those few broken guns of the Chinese army,

00:23:57.120 --> 00:23:58.320
they want to attack our gold mine?

00:23:58.320 --> 00:24:00.440
It's impossible within ten miles.

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:04.640
Tahara, you're overthinking.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:07.760
If it were a frontal assault, it wouldn't be scary.

00:24:07.760 --> 00:24:09.760
What I fear is another sneak attack.

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:13.010
Our transport trucks were frequently attacked before.

00:24:13.240 --> 00:24:14.840
That was Cui Wenpei's doing.

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:17.120
As the Chinese saying goes,

00:24:17.400 --> 00:24:19.520
better safe than sorry.

00:24:20.040 --> 00:24:21.120
That makes sense.

00:24:22.280 --> 00:24:25.340
General Kurokawa takes this gold mine very seriously.

00:24:25.560 --> 00:24:27.280
We can't afford any mistakes.

00:24:27.920 --> 00:24:28.800
Tahara,

00:24:29.200 --> 00:24:30.660
do you have any good ideas?

00:24:30.960 --> 00:24:33.360
I think we should transport it early

00:24:33.720 --> 00:24:36.440
and ship the gold ore to Fuyang as soon as possible,

00:24:36.440 --> 00:24:38.480
to avoid undue delay and trouble.

00:24:39.240 --> 00:24:41.100
You are very meticulous, Tahara.

00:24:41.440 --> 00:24:43.520
We'll do as you suggest.

00:24:43.840 --> 00:24:46.680
When the time comes, I'll personally escort it.

00:24:47.040 --> 00:24:49.100
Thank you for your trouble, Colonel.

00:25:00.400 --> 00:25:02.080
Today I overheard at the mine

00:25:02.480 --> 00:25:04.080
that Masao Tahara and that old devil Matsui

00:25:04.080 --> 00:25:06.280
will personally escort the gold to Luoyang.

00:25:06.280 --> 00:25:08.520
So there will be a battle to fight.

00:25:09.840 --> 00:25:12.920
But Matsui takes this transport very seriously.

00:25:13.240 --> 00:25:14.800
He will personally be in charge of the escort.

00:25:14.800 --> 00:25:17.880
They will definitely be equipped with light and heavy weapons along the way.

00:25:17.880 --> 00:25:19.320
With our guerrillas' weapons,

00:25:19.320 --> 00:25:20.840
it will be hard to even get close.

00:25:20.840 --> 00:25:22.240
Once the battle comes to a stalemate...

00:25:22.240 --> 00:25:24.360
The surrounding Japanese troops will immediately reinforce

00:25:24.360 --> 00:25:25.690
and cut off our retreat.

00:25:27.320 --> 00:25:29.800
We can choose to fight in Jiapigou.

00:25:30.520 --> 00:25:31.850
Jiapigou is the only way

00:25:31.880 --> 00:25:33.400
from Shanzhou City to Luoyang.

00:25:33.400 --> 00:25:36.120
It is also far from the Japanese sphere of influence.

00:25:36.120 --> 00:25:38.200
Even if Matsui and Tahara call for reinforcements,

00:25:38.200 --> 00:25:40.000
they won't arrive for two hours.

00:25:40.120 --> 00:25:42.880
And the treacherous terrain and dense forests there

00:25:42.880 --> 00:25:44.600
make it perfect for an ambush.

00:25:45.040 --> 00:25:46.120
After completing the mission,

00:25:46.120 --> 00:25:48.120
we will have time to evacuate safely.

00:25:48.120 --> 00:25:51.050
What about the heavy weapons of the Japanese troops?

00:25:51.880 --> 00:25:53.340
We can ask Wenkui for help.

00:25:53.600 --> 00:25:55.320
His independent brigade is well-equipped

00:25:55.320 --> 00:25:57.200
and can fight against the enemy.

00:25:57.800 --> 00:25:59.000
If we join forces,

00:25:59.400 --> 00:26:01.800
we should be able to end the battle quickly.

00:26:02.400 --> 00:26:03.280
Okay.

00:26:03.800 --> 00:26:04.640
Old Xu,

00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:06.760
you are responsible for contacting Cui Wenkui.

00:26:06.760 --> 00:26:08.200
Okay, I'll go right away.

00:26:22.560 --> 00:26:23.440
Colonel,

00:26:24.320 --> 00:26:26.280
you are truly brilliant.

00:26:27.920 --> 00:26:29.880
To predict that the Chinese army

00:26:30.200 --> 00:26:32.600
would target our gold transport vehicle.

00:26:32.960 --> 00:26:35.000
You sent a squadron early in the morning

00:26:35.000 --> 00:26:37.920
to set up a sniper position south of Dawang Town,

00:26:38.040 --> 00:26:40.170
making their ambush plan impossible.

00:26:43.040 --> 00:26:45.520
I just don't know

00:26:46.240 --> 00:26:47.480
if our squadron

00:26:47.960 --> 00:26:50.320
can withstand the Chinese army's attack.

00:26:51.760 --> 00:26:54.240
It is said that the general named Cui Wenkui

00:26:54.640 --> 00:26:56.480
is a very formidable character.

00:26:57.400 --> 00:26:59.800
He has fought our Imperial Army many times,

00:27:00.320 --> 00:27:03.120
and the Imperial Army has always suffered losses.

00:27:03.440 --> 00:27:06.200
Cui Wenkui is indeed a fierce general.

00:27:07.160 --> 00:27:09.880
But since he left the Nationalist Party,

00:27:10.440 --> 00:27:14.240
his ammunition and supplies have been cut off.

00:27:14.720 --> 00:27:16.960
The hijacking of the supply truck last time

00:27:16.960 --> 00:27:20.080
was because we were too careless,

00:27:20.400 --> 00:27:22.130
which allowed them to succeed.

00:27:22.360 --> 00:27:23.840
Now, this Cui Wenkui

00:27:24.240 --> 00:27:26.960
wouldn't dare confront me head-on.

00:27:27.520 --> 00:27:29.320
A tiger without claws,

00:27:29.720 --> 00:27:31.360
what is there to fear?

00:27:31.760 --> 00:27:33.960
Yes, the Colonel is right.

00:27:48.520 --> 00:27:49.400
Lao Xu.

00:27:50.200 --> 00:27:52.460
Did you confirm the time with Cui Wenkui?

00:27:52.920 --> 00:27:54.520
I explained it very carefully.

00:27:54.520 --> 00:27:55.920
I left nothing out.

00:27:57.040 --> 00:27:57.970
Look at the time.

00:27:58.280 --> 00:28:00.520
Why isn't his Independent Brigade here yet?

00:28:00.520 --> 00:28:01.560
Tell me about it.

00:28:03.600 --> 00:28:05.060
Do you think he backed out?

00:28:07.280 --> 00:28:08.120
No.

00:28:08.800 --> 00:28:11.400
Cui Wenkui wouldn't do that at a time like this.

00:28:12.720 --> 00:28:14.960
He must have run into some trouble.

00:28:16.320 --> 00:28:18.320
What now? Do we attack?

00:28:19.960 --> 00:28:21.840
We attack. We have to.

00:28:24.520 --> 00:28:26.760
But we can't attack head-on.

00:28:27.600 --> 00:28:29.000
We need to outsmart them.

00:28:29.680 --> 00:28:31.200
Baozi, stop keeping us in suspense.

00:28:31.200 --> 00:28:32.800
Tell us how to outsmart them.

00:28:34.560 --> 00:28:37.760
Have you all heard of 'Outsmarting the Birthday Convoy'?

00:28:38.320 --> 00:28:41.520
Today, we'll put on a show for the Japs.

00:28:49.640 --> 00:28:51.240
But it's been

00:28:51.960 --> 00:28:53.800
too quiet along the way.

00:28:54.240 --> 00:28:55.600
It's a bit unusual.

00:28:56.000 --> 00:28:56.660
Sandaoyuan

00:28:56.920 --> 00:28:59.360
is the active area of the Eighth Route Army guerrilla forces.

00:28:59.360 --> 00:29:02.240
Logically, they should have heard the news,

00:29:02.560 --> 00:29:04.280
and set up an ambush on the road.

00:29:04.280 --> 00:29:07.560
But we haven't seen a single soul so far.

00:29:26.040 --> 00:29:27.300
The guerrilla forces,

00:29:28.120 --> 00:29:29.980
their weapons are too primitive.

00:29:30.240 --> 00:29:31.920
Broadswords and crude guns

00:29:32.320 --> 00:29:35.520
pose no threat to us at all.

00:29:36.560 --> 00:29:39.080
If they want to hijack my transport,

00:29:39.520 --> 00:29:41.280
they are daydreaming.

00:29:41.480 --> 00:29:44.440
If they dare to face me in a head-on battle,

00:29:44.840 --> 00:29:45.840
killing them

00:29:46.360 --> 00:29:48.920
will be as easy as slaughtering pigs and cows.

00:29:49.480 --> 00:29:51.480
Without Cui Wenkui's support,

00:29:51.960 --> 00:29:54.280
they wouldn't have the guts.

00:29:55.600 --> 00:29:57.360
I actually want them to show up.

00:29:57.800 --> 00:29:59.800
Without them for entertainment,

00:30:00.240 --> 00:30:02.920
our journey would be too boring.

00:30:06.440 --> 00:30:08.640
We're about to leave Sandaoyuan.

00:30:09.280 --> 00:30:12.600
I don't think the guerrilla forces will appear again.

00:30:13.320 --> 00:30:16.840
I'm afraid the Colonel will be disappointed.

00:30:35.120 --> 00:30:38.040
Ando, you're right again.

00:30:39.040 --> 00:30:41.040
These pitiful Chinese people

00:30:41.640 --> 00:30:43.120
in their own territory

00:30:43.480 --> 00:30:45.120
are like mice.

00:30:45.680 --> 00:30:47.640
Sneaking around every day,

00:30:47.960 --> 00:30:49.680
they simply don't dare

00:30:49.840 --> 00:30:51.520
to move in broad daylight.

00:30:51.880 --> 00:30:54.740
The Eighth Route Army guerrillas may be unrefined,

00:30:54.880 --> 00:30:56.240
but they aren't fools.

00:30:56.360 --> 00:30:58.420
Why would they walk right into a trap?

00:31:02.520 --> 00:31:03.780
What's the situation?

00:31:05.880 --> 00:31:06.640
Quick.

00:31:07.120 --> 00:31:07.840
Hurry up.

00:31:15.760 --> 00:31:17.560
Officer, save us.

00:31:17.840 --> 00:31:19.500
Guerrillas are attacking us.

00:31:19.960 --> 00:31:21.240
Which unit are you from?

00:31:21.240 --> 00:31:24.880
We are delivering documents from Mianchi to Shanzhou.

00:31:27.440 --> 00:31:29.160
Wipe out those guerrillas.

00:31:33.680 --> 00:31:34.520
Retreat.

00:31:40.160 --> 00:31:41.520
Thank you for saving us, officer.

00:31:41.520 --> 00:31:42.450
You're welcome.

00:31:42.600 --> 00:31:44.040
We are all soldiers of the Imperial Army.

00:31:44.040 --> 00:31:45.920
You will take the second vehicle later

00:31:45.920 --> 00:31:47.180
to ensure your safety.

00:31:47.360 --> 00:31:48.480
Thank you.

00:32:07.520 --> 00:32:08.360
Bastards.

00:32:19.520 --> 00:32:21.080
Intercept them.

00:32:37.000 --> 00:32:37.920
Miss. Adjutant Zhu.

00:32:37.920 --> 00:32:38.520
Brother Cai.

00:32:38.520 --> 00:32:39.580
Where are your men?

00:32:40.360 --> 00:32:42.120
It's way past our agreed time.

00:32:42.400 --> 00:32:43.400
Don't mention it.

00:32:43.840 --> 00:32:45.920
We started off according to the original plan,

00:32:45.920 --> 00:32:48.000
but we encountered a Jap attack on the way.

00:32:48.000 --> 00:32:49.660
It took a lot to shake them off.

00:32:50.600 --> 00:32:52.480
What about Wenpei and Yuanshangfei?

00:32:52.480 --> 00:32:53.880
That's what I'm here for.

00:32:54.000 --> 00:32:55.760
Cui Wenpei and the gold transport truck

00:32:55.760 --> 00:32:56.890
are both at our base.

00:32:58.320 --> 00:32:59.080
It's a success.

00:32:59.080 --> 00:32:59.800
Yes.

00:33:01.280 --> 00:33:02.360
We succeeded.

00:33:03.720 --> 00:33:05.880
Brothers, we succeeded.

00:33:06.440 --> 00:33:08.280
Success, success, good.

00:33:09.440 --> 00:33:10.480
Are they alright?

00:33:10.920 --> 00:33:12.640
Wenpei and Yuanshangfei are both fine.

00:33:12.640 --> 00:33:13.960
Not even a scratch.

00:33:14.320 --> 00:33:15.360
Rest assured.

00:33:15.840 --> 00:33:17.120
I've delivered the message,

00:33:17.120 --> 00:33:18.280
so I'll take my leave.

00:33:18.280 --> 00:33:18.880
Thanks for your hard work.

00:33:18.880 --> 00:33:19.600
Okay.

00:33:21.080 --> 00:33:22.120
Then let's fall in.

00:33:22.120 --> 00:33:22.720
Fall in.

00:33:23.080 --> 00:33:23.610
Let's go.

00:33:23.840 --> 00:33:24.970
Extra food tonight.

00:33:25.360 --> 00:33:26.440
Okay. Let's go.

00:33:26.720 --> 00:33:27.360
Let's go.

00:33:28.600 --> 00:33:29.960
Let's go.

00:33:52.400 --> 00:33:54.660
You shoot so well. Where did you learn it?

00:33:55.040 --> 00:33:56.400
When I was a swordsman,

00:33:56.800 --> 00:33:59.060
I often fought with the security forces.

00:33:59.560 --> 00:34:01.120
They obviously couldn't beat us,

00:34:01.120 --> 00:34:02.400
so they set up ambushes secretly.

00:34:02.400 --> 00:34:04.080
So I pay special attention to

00:34:04.400 --> 00:34:05.640
The skill of locating by sound

00:34:05.640 --> 00:34:07.600
is to counterattack

00:34:07.880 --> 00:34:09.210
as quickly as possible.

00:34:10.280 --> 00:34:12.360
I remember when I was in the stronghold,

00:34:12.360 --> 00:34:14.400
I used to bet on drinks with my brothers.

00:34:14.400 --> 00:34:15.360
With this skill,

00:34:15.639 --> 00:34:17.320
I won a lot of good liquor from them.

00:34:17.320 --> 00:34:18.920
But later, when they bet again,

00:34:18.920 --> 00:34:20.719
they refused to include me.

00:34:22.480 --> 00:34:24.360
When I was training in Juntong,

00:34:24.639 --> 00:34:25.969
we had similar courses.

00:34:26.679 --> 00:34:29.540
But none of those instructors shot as well as you do.

00:34:31.239 --> 00:34:32.770
Teach me when you have time.

00:34:33.080 --> 00:34:34.139
You are so skilled,

00:34:34.440 --> 00:34:36.280
why would you need me to teach you?

00:34:36.280 --> 00:34:37.679
What do you mean?

00:34:38.400 --> 00:34:41.360
After all, we are comrades who have been through life and death together.

00:34:41.360 --> 00:34:42.420
I didn't mean that.

00:34:42.679 --> 00:34:43.760
If you really want to learn,

00:34:43.760 --> 00:34:45.290
I'll teach you everything.

00:34:45.840 --> 00:34:47.080
That's more like it.

00:34:52.320 --> 00:34:53.120
Get up.

00:35:02.920 --> 00:35:04.600
Since you help me so often,

00:35:04.920 --> 00:35:06.920
I'll mend these clothes for you.

00:35:49.640 --> 00:35:50.500
Brigadier Cui.

00:35:54.320 --> 00:35:55.720
What are you laughing at?

00:35:56.200 --> 00:35:56.880
Nothing.

00:35:59.040 --> 00:36:00.240
Have a seat.

00:36:05.080 --> 00:36:07.140
What are your orders, Brigadier Cui?

00:36:09.200 --> 00:36:10.600
What are you laughing at?

00:36:11.240 --> 00:36:12.200
Nothing.

00:36:17.440 --> 00:36:19.360
I just came to thank you

00:36:20.320 --> 00:36:22.720
for taking care of our Wenpei along the way.

00:36:23.000 --> 00:36:24.640
You are too polite, Commander Cui.

00:36:24.640 --> 00:36:27.240
Protecting the commissar is my duty.

00:36:35.000 --> 00:36:35.560
Right.

00:36:35.760 --> 00:36:38.280
Protecting your commissar is your duty.

00:36:40.080 --> 00:36:40.940
Yuanshangfei.

00:36:41.280 --> 00:36:42.120
There are no outsiders here.

00:36:42.120 --> 00:36:44.560
Let's have a heart-to-heart talk.

00:36:46.680 --> 00:36:47.720
You probably know

00:36:48.000 --> 00:36:49.040
that Wenpei and I

00:36:50.120 --> 00:36:52.050
were separated when we were young.

00:36:52.360 --> 00:36:53.440
But did you know

00:36:53.440 --> 00:36:55.680
that when she was little,

00:36:56.160 --> 00:36:58.640
she was the apple of my and our father's eye?

00:36:59.680 --> 00:37:01.000
We spoiled her

00:37:01.640 --> 00:37:03.640
and gave her the best of everything.

00:37:04.160 --> 00:37:06.240
I can hardly imagine over the years

00:37:07.400 --> 00:37:09.840
how much she has suffered and endured.

00:37:11.120 --> 00:37:14.080
Do you know that after finding her,

00:37:16.720 --> 00:37:17.960
I wanted to give her

00:37:18.400 --> 00:37:19.040
the best,

00:37:19.280 --> 00:37:21.010
to give her all the best things?

00:37:21.520 --> 00:37:22.650
As an older brother,

00:37:22.960 --> 00:37:24.600
I should take care of her.

00:37:26.240 --> 00:37:28.700
But a brother can't take care of her forever.

00:37:29.640 --> 00:37:30.600
So,

00:37:31.560 --> 00:37:33.840
I have a presumptuous request for you.

00:37:35.080 --> 00:37:36.360
Commander, please speak.

00:37:36.360 --> 00:37:38.760
I, Yuanshangfei, will do my best.

00:37:40.680 --> 00:37:42.680
We were both in the Nationalist army

00:37:43.360 --> 00:37:44.040
and have dealt with each other before.

00:37:44.040 --> 00:37:46.120
Of course, let the unpleasant past

00:37:46.800 --> 00:37:48.040
stay in the past.

00:37:50.800 --> 00:37:52.330
Your character and temper,

00:37:53.400 --> 00:37:54.320
I know.

00:37:54.720 --> 00:37:55.960
And I approve of them.

00:37:57.960 --> 00:37:59.960
You have to take good care of my sister for me.